Upstream-Name: hd-desktop
Comment: The wallpapers in /usr/share/backgrounds/hyprdebian are PNG renders
 of the Emerald theme SVGs from the Debian package desktop-base. The plymouth
 theme hyprdebian is based on the theme emerald of desktop-base; its
 background is the Emerald wallpaper, by Juliette Taka Belin, under the same
 license.
 .
 The binaries hd-menu and hd-message also hold the interface tables that
 wayland-scanner generates from two Wayland protocols: wlr-layer-shell, of
 wlr-protocols, and xdg-shell, of wayland-protocols. Their notices follow.
 .
 The fonts in /usr/share/fonts/truetype/jetbrains-mono-nerd are the
 JetBrains Mono Nerd Font of the Nerd Fonts release v3.4.0, unchanged: the
 families JetBrainsMono Nerd Font and JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono of the
 release zip. The package holds no other part of it.
 .
 JetBrains Mono 2.304 is the typeface of JetBrains, made by The JetBrains Mono
 Project Authors: https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono
 .
 Nerd Fonts, by Ryan L McIntyre and its contributors, patches the icons of
 these projects into it: https://www.nerdfonts.com/
 .
   Codicons                                CC BY 4.0
   Devicons                                MIT
   Font Awesome                            CC BY 4.0
   Font Awesome Extension                  MIT
   Font Logos                              Unlicensed
   IEC Power Symbols                       MIT
   Material Design Icons                   Apache 2.0
   Original Source (Seti-UI but modified)  MIT
   Octicons                                MIT
   Pomicons                                OFL-1.1
   Powerline Extra Symbols                 MIT
   Powerline Symbols                       Free License
   Weather Icons                           OFL-1.1
 .
 The list is from the license audit of Nerd Fonts v3.4.0:
 https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/blob/v3.4.0/license-audit.md
 .
 The patched fonts are a derivative of JetBrains Mono, and under its license,
 the SIL Open Font License 1.1. JetBrains Mono has no Reserved Font Name.
 /usr/share/doc/hd-desktop/nerd-fonts/OFL.txt is the license file of the
 release zip.

